index 0000000000000..0d4266a282b78
--- /dev/null
+++ b/tools/licenses/integration_metadata/README.md
@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+# Chromium integration metadata
+
+These README inputs describe six exact dependency/integration roots whose
+metadata cannot be carried at the normal location in the parent Chromium patch
+queue (DEPS/gitlinks or packaged toolchain files). They are parsed and validated
+by the ordinary metadata and license-file pipeline. They are not exclusions or
+license-text substitutes.
+
+An existing recognized dependency README always wins, including an invalid or
+empty one. Unknown roots receive no fallback. Missing metadata or referenced
+license files still fail strict scan. Versioned Rust crates retain their own
+metadata; the root entry describes only Chromium forwarding/build integration.
+Remove an integration entry when its upstream checkout supplies valid metadata.
+
+Each license file is existing source, referenced from the Chromium root. The
+Perfetto Chromium entry includes both BSD and Apache build-file headers. Crubit
+retains the complete Apache/LLVM and Unicode notice file; the latter corresponds
+to the SPDX Unicode-DFS-2015 text (https://spdx.org/licenses/Unicode-DFS-2015.html).
+LLVM's exception identifier is https://spdx.org/licenses/LLVM-exception.html.
+These are source attribution records, not a separate rights determination.
